repository-code: "https://github.com/bijanf/ardp"
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
keywords:
  - AMOC
  - freshwater transport
  - ocean reanalysis
  - CMIP6
  - South Atlantic
abstract: >-
  Python code for computing the overturning freshwater transport at 34.5S
  (F_ovS) from ocean reanalyses and CMIP6 output, decomposing its change into
  velocity-driven and salinity-driven contributions, and producing the figures
  and tables of the accompanying article.
